      "name": "Trump-Card Kitty",
      "unlock": "Elemental Burst",
      "description": "Trusty Cuilein-Anbar comes to save the day!\nThrows the doll named Cuilein-Anbar, causing an explosion that deals AoE Dendro DMG, creating a Cuilein-Anbar Zone. Cuilein-Anbar will bounce around within this zone, dealing AoE Dendro DMG.",
